*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0038
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 938
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0038.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-MTRM            PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    *> LOAN ELIGIBILITY Y/N
    05 L-EL               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "WS-MTRM=" WS-MTRM
    DISPLAY "L-EL=" L-EL
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF C-AG-YY >= 18
        *> SHORT TERM FOR OLDER BORROWERS
        IF C-AG-YY > 60
            MOVE 10 TO WS-MTRM
            MOVE 'Y' TO L-EL
        *> MEDIUM TERM CAP
        ELSE IF C-AG-YY > 55
            MOVE 20 TO WS-MTRM
            MOVE 'Y' TO L-EL
        ELSE
            MOVE 30 TO WS-MTRM
            MOVE 'Y' TO L-EL
        END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO L-EL
    END-IF.
